<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Kan Bozhou</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">fl. 460</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Kan Bozhou was a Chinese noble whom the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rouran-khaganate">Rouran Khaganate</a> installed as king of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gaochang">Gaochang</a> in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/turfan">Turfan</a> oasis in 460, after destroying the Northern Liang remnant there. His was the first of several short-lived dynasties of the Gaochang Kingdom before the Qu family took the throne around 500.</p></div>
